{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c &quot;Star Aquarium&quot; \u2013 Your Desk Becomes a Sea of Stars \ud83c\udf20</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still staring blankly at dull spreadsheets? Now, your Excel can breathe!<br>&quot;Star Aquarium&quot; transforms your screen into a dreamy underwater world, where dozens of pixel-art fish swim freely across documents, web pages, and code\u2014turning worktime into something warm and delightful~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 Why are office workers secretly installing this?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>The True Zero-Distraction Work Companion</strong><br>\u25b8 Fish intelligently avoid key work areas, swimming only in idle screen space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/image_en.png?t=1746610698\" />\u25b8 Supports one-key stealth mode (Ctrl+H to instantly hide)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Playful Pixel Fish School</strong><br>\u25b8 Collect over 20 species, including glowing jellyfish, rainbow clownfish, and starry pufferfish<br>\u25b8 Each fish has unique swimming patterns and interactive easter eggs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Hidden Work-Boosting Features</strong><br>\u25aa <strong>No-Background Mode</strong>: Fish swim freely over Excel\u2014work and &quot;relax&quot; at the same time<br>\u25aa <strong>Wallpaper Mode</strong>: Fish swim across your desktop wallpaper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/wallpaper_en.png?t=1746610698\" />\u25aa <strong>Adjustable Window Size</strong>: Customize the window to your needs with high flexibility</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703090?t=1746610698","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703090?t=174661